:"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>fathers. Joh 3:6; Ac 2:30; Ro 1:3; 9:3,5 corrected. 7 we gave. Ex 20:12; Le 19:3; De 21:18-21; 27:16; Pr 30:17; Eze 22:7; Eph 6:1-4 shall we not. Mal 1:6; Jas 4:7,10; 1Pe 5:6 the Father. Nu 16:22; 27:16; Job 12:10; Ec 12:7; Isa 42:5; 57:16; Zec 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-10","title":"Hebrews 12:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>after their own pleasure. or, as seemed good, or meet, tothem. but he. 5,6 partakers. Le 11:44,45; 19:2; Ps 17:15; Eze 36:25-27; Eph 4:24; 5:26,27 Col 1:22; Tit 2:14; 1Pe 1:15,16; 2:5,9; 2Pe 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-11","title":"Hebrews 12:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>no chastening. Ps 89:32; 118:18; Pr 15:10; 19:18 nevertheless. 5,6,10 peaceable. Ps 119:165; Isa 32:17; Ro 5:3-5; 14:17; 2Co 4:17; Ga 5:22,23 Jas 3:17,18 exercised. 5:14; 1Ti 4:7,8; 2Pe 2:14; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-12","title":"Hebrews 12:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>3,5; Job 4:3,4; Isa 35:3; Eze 7:17; 21:7; Da 5:6; Na 2:10; 1Th 5:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-13","title":"Hebrews 12:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>make. Pr 4:26,27; Isa 35:3,8-10; 40:3,4; 42:16; 58:12; Jer 18:15; Lu 3:5 straight. or, even. lame. Isa 35:6; Jer 31:8,9 but let. Ga 6:1; Jude 1:22,23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-14","title":"Hebrews 12:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>Follow. Ge 13:7-9; Ps 34:14; 38:20; 120:6; 133:1; Pr 15:1; 16:7; 17:14 Isa 11:6-9; Mt 5:9; Mr 9:50; Ro 12:18; 14:19; 1Co 1:10; Ga 5:22,23 Eph 4:1-8; 1Th 5:15; 1Ti 6:11; 2Ti 2:22; Jas 3:17,18; 1Pe 3:11 and holiness. 10; Ps 94:15; Isa 51:1; Lu 1:75; Ro 6:22; 2Co 6:17; 7:1; Php 3:12 1Th 3:13; 4:7; 1Pe 1:15,16; 3:13; 2Pe 3:11,18; 3Jo 1:11 no man. Ge 32:30; Job 19:26; 33:26; Mt 5:8; 1Co 13:12; 2Co 7:1; Eph 5:5 Ga 3:21; 1Jo 3:2,3; Re 21:24-27; 22:3,4,11-15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-15","title":"Hebrews 12:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Looking. 2:1,2; 3:12; 4:1,11; 6:11; 10:23-35; De 4:9; Pr 4:23; 1Co 9:24-27 1Co 10:12; 2Co 6:1; 13:5; 2Pe 1:10; 3:11,14; 2Jo 1:8; Jude 1:20,21 any man. Lu 22:32; 1Co 13:8; Ga 5:4 fail of. or, fall from. Ga 5:4 any root. 3:12; De 29:18; 32:32; Isa 5:4,7; Jer 2:21; Mt 7:16-18 trouble. Jos 6:18; 7:25,26; 22:17-20; Eph 5:3; Col 3:5 and thereby. Ex 32:21; 1Ki 14:16; Ac 20:30,31; 1Co 5:6; 15:33; Ga 2:13 2Ti 2:16,17; 2Pe 2:1,2,18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-16","title":"Hebrews 12:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>any fornicator. 13:4; Mr 7:21; Ac 15:20,29; 1Co 5:1-6,9-11; 6:15-20; 10:8; 2Co 12:21 Ga 5:19-21; Eph 5:3,5; Col 3:5; 1Th 4:3-7; Re 2:20-23; 21:8; 22:15 as Esau. Ge 25:31-34; 27:36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-17","title":"Hebrews 12:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>when he. Ge 27:31-41 he was. 6:8; Pr 1:24-31; Jer 6:30; Mt 7:23; 25:11,12; Lu 13:24-27 for he. 6:4-6; 10:26-29 place for repentance. or, way to change his mind.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-18","title":"Hebrews 12:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>Ex 19:12-19; 20:18; 24:17; De 4:11; 5:22-26; Ro 6:14; 8:15; 2Ti 1:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-19","title":"Hebrews 12:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>the sound. Ex 19:16-19; 1Co 15:52; 1Th 4:16 and the voice. Ex 20:1-17,22; De 4:12,33; 5:3-22 they that. Ex 20:18,19; De 5:24-27; 18:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-20","title":"Hebrews 12:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>For they. De 33:2; Ro 3:19,20; Ga 2:19; 3:10 if so much. Ex 19:13,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-21","title":"Hebrews 12:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Moses. Ex 19:16,19; Ps 119:120; Isa 6:3-5; Da 10:8,17; Re 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-22","title":"Hebrews 12:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>ye are come. Ps 2:6; 48:2; 132:13,14; Isa 12:6; 14:32; 28:16; 51:11,16; 59:20 Isa 60:14; Joe 2:32; Ro 11:26; Ga 4:26; Re 14:1 the city. 13:14; Ps 48:2; 87:3; Mt 5:35; Php 3:20; *marg: Re 3:12; 21:2,10; 22:19 of the. 3:12; 9:14; 10:31; De 5:26; Jos 3:10; 2Ki 19:4; Ps 42:2; 84:2 Jer 10:10; Da 6:26; Ho 1:10; Mt 16:16; Ro 9:26; 1Th 1:9; Re 7:2 an innumerable. De 33:2; Ps 68:17; Da 7:10; Jude 1:14; Re 5:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-23","title":"Hebrews 12:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the general. Ps 89:7; 111:1; Ac 20:28; Eph 1:22; 5:24-27; Col 1:24; 1Ti 3:5 the firstborn. Ex 4:22; 13:2; De 21:17; Ps 89:27; Jer 31:9; Jas 1:18; Re 14:4 which. Ex 32:32; Ps 69:28; Lu 10:20; Php 4:3; Re 13:8; 20:15 written. or, enrolled. God. 6:10-12; 9:27; Ge 18:25; Ps 50:5,6; 94:2; 96:13; 98:9; Mt 25:31-34 Joh 5:27; 2Th 1:5-7; 1Pe 2:23 the spirits. 11:4,40; Ec 12:7; 1Co 13:12; 15:49,54; 2Co 5:8; Php 1:21-23 Php 3:12-21; Col 1:12; Re 7:14-17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-24","title":"Hebrews 12:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>Jesus. 7:22; 8:6,8; 1Ti 2:5 new. 13:20; Isa 55:3; Jer 31:31-33 covenant. or, testament. 9:15; Mt 26:28; Mr 14:24; Lu 22:20 to the blood. 9:21; 10:22; 11:28; Ex 24:8; 1Pe 1:2 speaketh. 11:4; Ge 4:10; Mt 23:35; Lu 11:51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-25","title":"Hebrews 12:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>See. 8:5; Ex 16:29; 1Ki 12:16; Isa 48:6; 64:9; Mt 8:4; 1Th 5:15; 1Pe 1:22 Re 19:10; 22:9 refuse. Pr 1:24; 8:33; 13:18; 15:32; Jer 11:10; Eze 5:6; Zec 7:11; Mt 17:5 Ac 7:35 if they. 2:1-3; 3:17; 10:28,29 turn away. Nu 32:15; De 30:17; Jos 22:16; 2Ch 7:19; Pr 1:32; 2Ti 4:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-26","title":"Hebrews 12:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>voice. Ex 19:18; Ps 114:6,7; Hab 3:10 Yet once. 27; Isa 2:19; 13:13; Joe 3:16; Hag 2:6,7,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-27","title":"Hebrews 12:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>signifieth. Ps 102:26,27; Eze 21:27; Mt 24:35; 2Pe 3:10,11; Re 11:15; 21:1 are shaken. or, may be shaken.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-28","title":"Hebrews 12:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":12,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":12,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>a kingdom. Isa 9:7; Da 2:44; 7:14,27; Mt 25:34; Lu 1:33; 17:20,21; 1Pe 1:4,5 Re 1:6; 5:10 have. or, hold fast. 3:6; 10:23 we may. Ps 19:14; Isa 56:7; Ro 12:1,2; Eph 1:6; 5:10; Php 4:18; 1Pe 2:5,20 with reverence. 4:16; 5:7; 10:19,22; Le 10:3; Ps 2:11; 89:7; Pr 28:24; Ro 11:20 1Pe 1:17; Re 15:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-12-29","title":"Hebrews 12:29"